 ⏺ [1;4mReading the session layer[0m

   The [1msession layer[0m wraps [3macpx[0m so the interface never touches a process. Start
   with [38;2;177;185;249msrc/session/session.ts[39m, then see the [4m[38;2;140;200;255mACP spec[0m
   [2m(https://agentclientprotocol.com)[0m for the wire format.

   [1mWhat it does[0m

   [2m-[0m opens one persistent session per chord session
   [2m-[0m starts turns with [38;2;177;185;249mstartTurn[39m and cancels them
     [2m1.[0m a cancel stops the turn at once
     [2m2.[0m the agent is told with [38;2;177;185;249msession/cancel[39m
